---
source: crates/specforge-cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Search for extensions in registries

Usage: specforge search [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>
          Search query

Options:
      --contributes <CONTRIBUTES>
          Only extensions that declare this category of contribution

          Possible values:
          - entities:         entity kinds
          - edges:            edge types
          - shared_fields:    shared fields
          - enhancements:     enhancements of other extensions' kinds
          - validation_rules: validation rules
          - surfaces:         commands, MCP tools and resources
          - collectors:       test collectors
          - analyzers:        source analyzers
          - passes:           compiler passes
          - feature_flags:    feature flags

      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
